{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349910/extras/0f7fb7fb0bdbe3e6a7bd0eb78c880703.poster.avif?t=1772857346\" width=920 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349910/extras/0f7fb7fb0bdbe3e6a7bd0eb78c880703.webm?t=1772857346\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349910/extras/0f7fb7fb0bdbe3e6a7bd0eb78c880703.mp4?t=1772857346\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Carhem</strong> is a chaotic multiplayer car brawler, where you and up to 7 other friends battle it out for victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive, jump, dash, and smash your friends off the map, survive moving circles, use unique abilities, and collect as many items as you can - all while the chaos escalates each round.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SURVIVE TO WIN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349910/extras/a94c648bbbf93abac6fbf57da41beb2e.poster.avif?t=1772857346\" width=920 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349910/extras/a94c648bbbf93abac6fbf57da41beb2e.webm?t=1772857346\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349910/extras/a94c648bbbf93abac6fbf57da41beb2e.mp4?t=1772857346\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only way to win is to outlast your opponents. With the circle constantly moving and shrinking, you'll have to balance fighting your friends with making sure you reach it on time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2026 And whatever you do, don't fall off the map.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNLEASH UNIQUE ABILITIES AND ITEMS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349910/extras/6bfb7278b59959e8908aa66d187db928.poster.avif?t=1772857346\" width=920 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349910/extras/6bfb7278b59959e8908aa66d187db928.webm?t=1772857346\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349910/extras/6bfb7278b59959e8908aa66d187db928.mp4?t=1772857346\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carhem features 12 cars - each with their own strengths, and more than a dozen crazy items that completely change how the game is played.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your car with:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bigger collisions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Damage increases</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extra jumps and air dashes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All wheel drive upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And wild transformations</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stack the items and become a god!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ESCALATING CHAOS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349910/extras/5ecb15e87069eb45b6cd4a08413ea4e8.poster.avif?t=1772857346\" width=920 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349910/extras/5ecb15e87069eb45b6cd4a08413ea4e8.webm?t=1772857346\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349910/extras/5ecb15e87069eb45b6cd4a08413ea4e8.mp4?t=1772857346\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every game starts out with small collisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > But as the rounds progress, damage is dealt, and items are collected, the chaos escalates dramatically.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a few rounds, just one small hit can send your rivals flying off the map.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 cars</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15 items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jumps + air dashes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Car damage that scales collisions as it increases\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proximity chat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watching your friends disappear into the distance after you smash them</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3349910?t=1772857346","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3349910?t=1772857346","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349910/32ceccd848d7cb944bb25d0bf67c98b62861919d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772857346","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349910/32ceccd848d7cb944bb25d0bf67c98b62861919d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772857346","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/33